  "description": "THE SUPER ODIN EXPERIENCE\nRide bold on The Vamoose Super Odin a 52V 750W rear motor mountain crusher. Comes equipped with Full Suspension, Torque Sensor, In-Frame Battery, Rear Rack and Long Fenders.\nFULL SUSPENSION, TORQUE SENSOR\nUnleash the beast with the Super ODIN, a full-suspension, 52V 750W mountain dominator that's ready to crush any trail that dares to stand in its way. Armed with a torque sensor, beefy 4.8\" MAXXIS tires, and a monstrous 52V 20Ah battery, this bike is a true trail titan. Feel the thrill as its upgraded shocks devour bumps and smooth out the chatter, making every ride not just enjoyable, but epically plush. With hydraulic disc brakes, stylish fenders, and a handy rear rack, the Super ODIN comes fully loaded and ready to roll. It’s more than just an ebike; it’s your ticket to adventure with flair. Ready to rule the trails?\nThis Super Odin cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• BAFANG 750W motor\n\n• 52V 20 Ah Samsung Battery\n\n• New Front Suspension with 120mm travel\n\n• Torque sensor\n\n• 7 Speed Shimano Derailleur\n\n• Hydraulic Tektro Dorado quad piston brakes\n\n• Front and rear LED lights\n\n• MAXXIS™ Minion tires\nSPECIFICATION PDF\n\nSPECIFICATIONS\n\nMotor Format:\nRear\n\nFront Motor:\nN/A\n\nMid Motor:\nN/A\n\nRear Motor:\nBAFANG GO62 52V 750W\n\nDerailleur and shifters:\nSHIMANO Acera 7-SPEED\n\nThrottle:\nTwist Throttle w/o shut off\n\nDisplay:\nAPT 860C with USB\n\nBattery:\n21700 50 E CELLS 52V 20 Ah Samsung\n\nCharger:\n4A ST UL Standard\n\nFront forks :\nBOXER 120 mm travel air fork\n\nRear Suspension:\nDNM AO 38RC air shock\n\nFrame:\nLRG 6061 Aluminum\n\nBrakes:\nTektro HD-E3520 2 piston\n\nWheels:\n26\" x 4.8\" MAXXIS MINION FBR FBF\n\nPedals:\nGINEYEA Aluminum K303\n\nSaddle:\nVelo Plush\n\nFront and Rear Racks:\nFront rack ready, Rear rack standard\n\nFenders:\nAluminum\n\nFront and rear lights:\nFront photosensitive, Rear brake actuated\n\nADDITIONAL ATTRIBUTES\n\nTorque:\n100 Nm MAX Torque\n\nWatt Hours:\n1040\n\nMiles per charge:\n52 mi\n\nKms per charge:\n84 kms\n\nBattery charge time:\n4-6 hrs.\n\nUSB Plugin:\nYES\n\nWEIGHTS AND DIMENSIONS\n\nBox dimensions (cm):\n168 x 32.5 x 86.5\n\nBox dimensions (inch):\n66 X 13 X 34\n\nWeights (metric):\n37kg NW / 46 kg GW\n\nWeights (imperial):\n81.5 lbs NW / 101 lbs GW\n\nMax Speed (metric):\n32 km/h max speed\n\nMax Speed (imperial):\n20 m/h max speed\n\nMax Load:\n330 lbs.",
